"aoss:collection": [
"logs"
]
}
}
}
]
}
Note
In addition, OpenSearch Serverless requires the aoss:APIAccessAll and
aoss:DashboardsAccessAll permissions for collection resources. For more information,
see the section called “Using OpenSearch API operations”.
